{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\n新内眞衣です(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いたら７月も１週間が\n過ぎていて\n時の流れの速さに\nついていけてません..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ち的にはまだ６月なんだけど\n容赦ない日差しが\n夏の到来を実感させますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏は得意ではないけど\n今年は少しずつでも\n好きになれるように\n思い出をたくさん作りたいな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"軽井沢の女(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで最近の出来事！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂頭脳王決定戦\n７位でした～(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん的には\n意外？？想像通り？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル期間中に\n抜き打ちテストがあったので\n本当に自信がなかったのですが\n割と点数が取れてて\n嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は早押し問題やりたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂SHOWの収録"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の詩以来の収録！\nまだまだ映像を撮られ慣れて\nいない感が凄いですが\n良かったらみて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった後は、\n日奈子と蘭世と合流して\nお買い物と夜ご飯を\n食べに行ったよん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は焼肉がいい！って\n言ってたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１時間待ちだったから、\n私のよく行くカフェに\n連れて行きました～(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらね！\n２人ともまた行きたいって\n言ってくれたんだよ！\n癒された～(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行こうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OLランチ会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上司と他部署のお姉さま方と\nランチに行ってきたよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までずっとデスクで\nご飯を食べてたんだけど、\nそれを見兼ねて、\n上司が外へ連れてってくれましたT_T"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他部署のお姉さま方は\n2人ともはじめましてだったんだけど\n優しくて面白かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事の話\nお洋服の話\n化粧品の話\nお姉さま方の恋愛話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど、\n久しぶりにGIRLｓTALK\nというものをした気がする～笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当楽しかったです(*^_^*)\nまたご飯に行けたらいいな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は夏のFree&Easyの発売日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の個人PVはタイプCに収録\nされておりますよん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして\n週末はアンダーライブと\n個別握手会があります(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブは\n前回の反省点を活かして\nおもいっきり楽しみたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会は\n3部と5部！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難いことにどちらも完売\nしていると聞いたので、\nきてくれる方々は楽しみましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\nまた更新します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/07/08/3011355/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んぱっっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眞衣"}],"source":"archive"}